core":58,"readCost":22,"rule":"body:clarification sought|rumou?r ver","confidence":0.65,"body":"Persistent Systems Limited, Bhageerath, 402 Senapati Bapat Road, Pune 411 016, Maharashtra, India CIN - L72300PN1990PLC056696 Tel: +91 (20) 6703 5555 | Fax - +91 (20) 6703 6003 | E-mail - info@persistent.com | Website - www.persistent.com NSE & BSE / 2026-27 / 175 November 23, 2026 The Manager Corporate Services National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai 400 051 Ref: Symbol: PERSISTENT The Manager Corporate Services BSE Limited P J Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai 400 001 Ref: Scrip Code: 533179 Dear Sir/Madam, Sub.: Company Statement We are aware that a U.S.-based law firm that Persistent Systems (the ‘Company’) engaged for immigration matters of the Company may have experienced a cybersecurity incident, and certain of our employee immigration data and supporting documentation was purportedly exfiltrated from that law firm. We hereby wish to inform that our systems are secure, and our business operations continue to be normal. Claims that the Company’s critical information was stolen is unverified as the law firm was not in possession of such information. This is for your information and record. Please acknowledge receipt. Thanking you, Yours sincerely, For Persistent Systems Limited Amit Atre Company Secretary ICSI Membership No.: A20507Signature:Email:Amit Atre (Nov 23, 2026 07:26:15 GMT+5.5) Amit Atreamit_atre@persistent.com","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"4e44b7d9ce39","symbol":"ASIANPAINT","company":"Asian Paints Ltd","date":"2026-11-23","at":"2026-11-23T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","subject":"Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","note":"Asian Paints to meet Capital International in one-on-one on 27 Nov 2026 in Mumbai.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f08028ba-34c7-42