h November, 2026 about the execution of the Asset Purchase Agreement between the Company and Vimal Plast (India) Private Limited (“Vimal”) whereby the Company will acquire movable assets such as Moulds, Research & Development Lab equipment, Basket Assembly Korean machines, jigs and fixtures etc. (hereinafter collectively referred to as “Assets”), from Vimal, for an amount of up to INR 49,75,00,000/- (Rupees Forty Nine Crores and Seventy Five Lakhs Only), we would like to inform that upon completion of the closing formalities, the transaction has been consummated today, i.e. on 21st November, 2026. We request you to kindly take this on your records and oblige. Thanking you, For Dixon Technologies (India) Limited Ashish Kumar President- Chief Legal Counsel & Group Company Secretary Regd. Office: B-14 & 15, Phase-II, Noida-201305, (U.P.) India, Ph.:0120-4737200 E-mail: info@dixoninfo.com • Website: http://www.dixoninfo.com/ • Fax: 0120-4737263 CIN: L32101UP1993PLC066581","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"81aad3757542","symbol":"HDFCBANK","company":"HDFC Bank Ltd","date":"2026-11-20","at":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Outcome of Postal_Ballot","subject":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Outcome of Postal_Ballot","note":"HDFC Bank shareholders approve re-appointment of Lily Vadera as Independent Director via postal ballot with 99.092% votes in favour.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8359e2b1-9d38-4a6a-861f-81104a158350.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"press_release","kind":"press","baseScore":34,"readCost":10,"rule":"body-upgrade:order|contract|bagging|wins?|lau","confidence":0.75,"body":"111 U HDFC BANK Regd. Office: HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai – 400 013 Ref. No. SE/2026-27/152 November 20, 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Dept. of Corporate Services The Listing Department Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Exchange Plaza, Dalal Street, Fort, Bandra Kurla Complex, Mumbai – 400 001 Mumbai – 400 051 Scrip Code: 500180 Scrip Symbol: HDFCBANK Dear Sir / Madam, Sub: Intimation under Regulations 30 and 44 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“Listing Regulations”) In continuation to our earlier intimation dated October 21, 2026 and pursuant to Regulations 30 and 44 of the Listing Regulations, we hereby submit the results of e-voting on the resolution mentioned in the Postal Ballot Notice of the Bank dated October 17, 2026. Based on the report issued by the Scrutinizer i.e. Mr. B. Narasimhan, Proprietor of M/s. BN & Associates, Company Secretaries, we wish to inform you that the following resolution placed before the shareholders for approval through postal ballot, has been passed with requisite majority and the same is deemed to have been approved on the last date of e-voting period i.e. Friday, November 20, 2026. Sr. No Particulars Type of resolution 1 Re-appointment of Mrs. Lily Vadera (DIN: 09400410) as an Independent Director of the Bank Special Resolution Further, please find enclosed herewith the e-voting results in the prescribed format along with a Report issued by the Scrutinizer dated November 20, 2026. The aforesaid documents are also being made available on the Bank’s website, website of National Securities Depository Limited (e-voting service provider) and on the notice board at the Bank’s registered office. You are requested to kindly take the same on record. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For HDFC Bank Limited Ajay Agarwal Company Secretary Group Head – Secretarial & Group Oversight Encl.: a/a cc: New York Stock Exchange Singapore Exchange Securities Trading Limited 11, Wall Street, 2 Shenton Way New York, # 02-00 SGX Centre 1 NY 10005 Singapore 068804 USA CIN: L65920MH1994PLC080618 Email: shareholder.grievances@hdfc.bank.in Website: www.hdfc.bank.in HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC House, H T Parekh Marg, 165-166 Backbay Reclamation, Churchgate, Mumbai- 400 020 Tel. No.:022-66316000 MEI INIIIMI NMI SCRUTINIZER'S REPORT MOM \\MIIM MMI ASSOCIATES Company Secretaries [Pursuant to sections 108 and 110 of the Companies Act, 2013 and Rules 20 and 22 of the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014] Date: November 20, 2026 To, The Chairman HDFC Bank Limited HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai 400 013. Sub: HDFC Bank Limited - Scrutinizer's Report on Postal Ballot (E-voting) Results I, B Narasimhan, Proprietor of BN & Associates, Company Secretaries, had been appointed as a Scrutinizer by the Board of Directors of HDFC Bank Limited (hereinafter referred to as the \"Bank\") at its meeting held on October 17, 2026 to scrutinize the e-voting process in a fair and transparent manner in respect of the resolution as stated in the Postal Ballot Notice dated October 17, 2026 (the \"Postal Ballot Notice\"). In compliance with the provisions of Sections 108 and 110 of the Companies Act, 2013 (the \"Act\") read with Rules 20 and 22 of the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014, including any statutory amendment(s), modification(s), variation(s) or re-enactment(s) thereto, for the time being in force and in compliance with the applicable guidelines / circulars / rules issued by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs (\"MCA\") inter alia including General Circular No. 03/2025 dated September 22, 2025 read with other relevant circulars issued by MCA (\"MCA Circulars\") from time to time, Regulation 44 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (\"SEBI Listing Regulations\"), Secretarial Standard on General M","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"f61334aeb090","symbol":"TITAN","company":"Titan Company Ltd","date":"2026-11-20","at":"2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimatio