egory":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","confidence":0.9,"body":null,"bodyFetched":false},{"id":"ee0b0edd7fbb","symbol":"HDFCBANK","company":"HDFC Bank Ltd","date":"2026-11-17","at":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Grant Of Stock Options And Restricted Stock Units Under ESOP/RSU Scheme","subject":"Grant Of Stock Options And Restricted Stock Units Under ESOP/RSU Scheme","note":"HDFC Bank granted 1,86,031 stock options and 41,377 RSUs on November 17, 2026.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5f857401-ae59-416d-9fa3-95705fa2e4d0.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"unclassified","kind":"esop","baseScore":3,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:allotment of (equity shares unde","confidence":0.9,"body":"Regd. Office: HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai – 400 013 Ref. No. SE/2026-27/150 November 17, 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Dept of Corporate Services The Listing Department Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Exchange Plaza Dalal Street, Fort, Bandra Kurla Complex, Mumbai 400 001 Mumbai 400 051 Scrip code: 500180 Scrip code: HDFCBANK Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Grant of stock options under Employee Stock Option Scheme (ESOS – Plan H-2024) and Grant of Restricted Stock Units under Employees’ Stock Incentive Master Scheme – 2022 Pursuant to the applicable provisions of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we wish to inform you that today, i.e. on November 17, 2026, the Governance, Nomination and Remuneration Committee (GNRC) of the Bank, has granted: (1) 1,86,031 equity stock options of the face value of Re. 1/- (“options”) each at the grant price of Rs. 816.50 (Rupees Eight Hundred Sixteen and Fifty Paise only) convertible into one equity share each of the Bank upon vesting and exercise under Employees’ Stock Option Scheme ESOS – Plan H-2024 (ESOS 066). Vesting of the options shall happen in 4 stages as under: • 25% rounded off to the nearest 100 on completion of twelve months from the grant date • 25% rounded off to the nearest 100 on completion of twenty-four months from the grant date • 25% rounded off to the nearest 100 on completion of thirty-six months from the grant date • Balance on completion of forty-eight months from the grant date The vested options must be exercised within a period of 4 years from the respective dates of their vesting, failing which, they shall lapse forthwith. The options have been granted under the Scheme titled Employees’ Stock Option Scheme (ESOS) – Plan H-2024 (ESOS 066) in terms of SEBI (Share Based Employee Benefits and Sweat Equity) Regulations, 2021 as amended from time to time. (2) 41,377 restricted stock units of face value of Re. 1/- (“units”) each at the grant price of Re. 1/- (Rupee One only) convertible into one equity share of Re. 1 each of the Bank upon vesting and exercise in terms of the Employees’ Stock Incentive Master Scheme – 2022 under the scheme titled “RSU 021”. Vesting of the units shall happen in 4 stages as under: • 25% rounded off to the nearest 10 on completion of twelve months from the grant date • 25% rounded off to the nearest 10 on completion of twenty-four months from the grant date • 25% rounded off to the nearest 10 on completion of thirty-six months from the grant date • Balance on completion of forty-eight months from the grant date CIN: L65920MH1994PLC080618 Email: shareholder.grievances@hdfc.bank.in Website: www.hdfc.bank.in HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC House, H T Parekh Marg, 165-166 Backbay Reclamation, Churchgate, Mumbai- 400 020 Tel. No.:022-66316000 Regd. Office: HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai – 400 013 The vested units must be exercised within a period of 1 year from the respective dates of their vesting, failing which, they shall lapse forthwith. The units have been granted under the Scheme titled “RSU 021” in terms of SEBI (Share Based Employee Benefits and Sweat Equity) Regulations, 2021 as amended from time to time. This is for your information and appropriate dissemination. Yours sincerely, For HDFC Bank Limited Ajay Agarwal Company Secretary Group Head – Secretarial & Group Oversight Copy to: 1. New York Stock Exchange 2. Singapore Exchange Securities Trading Limited 11, Wall Street, New York 2 Shenton Way 068804 NY 10005, USA # 02-00 SGX Centre 1 Singapore","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"f72b458ceb37","symbol":"HDFCBANK","company":"HDFC Bank Ltd","date":"2026-11-17","at":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Allotment of ESOP / ESPS","subject":"Allotment of ESOP / ESPS","note":"Allotment of 14,12,278 equity shares pursuant to the exercise of ESOP/RSU.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3c252309-6a76-41db-b704-e8c0e51c8d14.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"unclassified","kind":"esop","baseScore":3,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:allotment of (equity shares unde","confidence":0.9,"body":"Regd. Office: HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai – 400 013 Ref. No. SE/2026-27/149 November 17, 2026 BSE Limited Dept of Corporate Services Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Fort, Mumbai 400 001 Scrip Code: 500180 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Listing Department Exchange Plaza Bandra Kurla Complex, Mumbai 400 051 Scrip Symbol: HDFCBANK Dear Sir, Sub: Allotment of 14,12,278 equity shares pursuant to exercise of ESOP/RSU We wish to inform you that the Bank has allotted today 14,12,278 equity shares to the employees of the Bank pursuant to exercise of Options/RSU’s under its Employees Stock Options Schemes and Employee Stock Incentive Scheme. The Paid-up Share Capital of the Bank will accordingly increase from 15,43,24,11,468 equity shares of Re. 1/- each to 15,43,38,23,746 equity shares of Re.1/- each. Kindly take the same on your record. Thanking you, Yours Truly, For HDFC Bank Limited Ajay Agarwal Company Secretary Group Head – Secretarial & Group Oversight CIN: L65920MH1994PLC080618 Email: shareholder.grievances@hdfc.bank.in Website: www.hdfc.bank.in HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC House, H T Parekh Marg, 165-166 Backbay Reclamation, Churchgate, Mumbai- 400 020 Tel. No.:022-66316000","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"456e66a5a875","symbol":"RELIANCE","company":"Reliance Industries Ltd","date":"2026-11-17","at":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Update On Institutional Investors'' Meeting - JM Financial India Conference","subject":"Update On Institutional Investors'' Meeting - JM Financial India Conference","note":"Reliance executives attended JM Financial India Conference in Mumbai on November 17, 2026, with no UPSI shared.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=eadec632-3d3c-49bd-8f85-6d26d79a4332.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","confidence":0.9,"body":null,"bodyFetched":false},{"id":"9f61f36ac23f","symbol":"CGPOWER","company":"CG Power & Industrial Solutions Ltd","date":"2026-11-17","at":"2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Change in Management","subject":"Change in Management","note":"Vice President-Services Rajat Shah resigned effective 17 November 2026 due to family medical emergency.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=a1c637fe-d697-4b2c-8702-e03f45a1180d.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"management_change","kind":"people","baseScore":93,"readCost":30,"rule":"subject:(appoint|cessation|resign|supera","confidence":0.9,"body":"CG Power and Industrial Solutions Limited Registered Office: ONE UNITY CENTER,