) as a Whole-time Director (designated as Executive Director) of the Bank for a period of 1 (one) year effective from November 23, 2026, at the extant remuneration, subject to approval of the shareholders of the Bank. Please note that the approval of the shareholders of the Bank for re-appointment of Mr. Rangan as a Whole- time Director (designated as Executive Director) of the Bank, would be sought. Mr. Rangan is not related to any other Director or other Key Managerial Personnel of the Bank. Further, he is not debarred from holding the office of a director, by virtue of any SEBI order or any other such authority. The details as required in terms of disclosure under Regulation 30 read with Clause 7 of Paragraph A of Part A of Schedule III to the SEBI Listing Regulations read with SEBI Master Circular no. HO/49/14/14(7)2025-CFD-POD2/I/3762/2026 dated January 30, 2026 are enclosed herewith as Annexure I. CIN: L65920MH1994PLC080618 Email: shareholder.grievances@hdfc.bank.in Website: www.hdfc.bank.in HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC House, H.T. Parekh Marg 165-166, Backbay Reclamation, Churchgate, Mumbai- 400020 Tel.:022-66316000 This is for your information and appropriate dissemination. Thank you. Yours faithfully, For HDFC Bank Limited Ajay Agarwal Company Secretary Group Head – Secretarial & Group Oversight Copy to: 1. New York Stock Exchange 11, Wall Street, New York NY 10005, USA 2. Singapore Exchange Securities Trading Limited 2 Shenton Way 068804 # 02-00 SGX Centre 1 Singapore Annexure I Sr. No. Particulars Description 1. Reason for Change viz. appointment, re-appointment, resignation, removal, death or otherwise Mr. V. Srinivasa Rangan is re-appointed as a Whole-time Director (designated as Executive Director) of the Bank period of 1 (one) year effective from November 23, 2026, subject to approval of the shareholders of the Bank. 2. Date of appointment/ re-appointment/ cessation (as applicable) & term of appointment/re-appointment Mr. V. Srinivasa Rangan is re-appointed as a Whole-time Director (designated as Executive Director) of the Bank period of 1 (one) year effective from November 23, 2026, at the extant remuneration as approved by RBI, subject to approval of the shareholders of the Bank and is liable to retire by rotation. He continues to be a Key Managerial Personnel of the Bank. 3. Brief profile (in case of appointment) As provided in Annexure II. 4. Disclosure of relationships between directors (in case of appointment of a director) Not related to any other Director or Key Managerial Personnel of the Bank. Annexure II PROFILE — MR. V. SRINIVASA RANGAN Mr. V. Srinivasa Rangan, aged sixty-six (66) years, is the Executive Director of the Bank and heads the Human Resources, Corporate Legal, Group Oversight & Secretarial, Investment Banking, Information Security Group, Ethics Function and Fraud & Vigilance functions of the ","bodyFetched":true,"line":"V. Srinivasa Rangan re-appointed Executive Director for one more year from 23 Nov — continuity, not change.","lineSource":"filing","people":[{"name":"V. Srinivasa Rangan","role":"Executive Director","action":"re-appointed","effective":"2026-11-23","career":[{"org":"HDFC Bank","title":"Executive Director","from":null,"to":null}],"education":[],"profileSource":"filing"}]},{"id":"b9e1d98679eb","symbol":"RELIANCE","company":"Reliance Industries Ltd","date":"2026-11-13","at":"2026-11-13T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","subject":"Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","note":"The Company executives will be participating in the Institutional Investors'' Meeting - Morgan Stanley 25th Annual Asia-Pacific Summit, scheduled to be held on November ....","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=3f614a9e-94b0-42ef-8145-ba0055ba7be5.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:ana