ex","baseScore":64,"readCost":16,"rule":"subject:capex|capacity|commission|commer","confidence":0.9,"body":"November 12, 2026 BSE Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Fort, Mumbai 400001 Scrip Code: 532504 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai 400051 Symbol: NAVINFLUOR Dear Sir / Madam, Sub.: Intimation under Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 - Commercialization of additional hydrofluorocarbons (HFC) capacity upto 15K MTPA R32 equivalent quantity This refers to our earlier intimation dated October 30, 2025, inter alia informing about, approval of the Board of Directors for funding of ₹236.50 Crores for setting up an additional hydrofluorocarbons (‘HFC’) capacity upto 15K MTPA R32 equivalent quantity at Surat unit of the Company. In this regard, we wish to inform that the plant for manufacture and supply of HFC (R32) has commenced commercial operations today and will be ramped-up progressively. This intimation is also being made available on the Company’s website www.nfil.in. Kindly take this intimation on your record. Thanking You, Yours faithfully, For NAVIN FLUORINE INTERNATIONAL LIMITED Niraj B. Mankad President Legal and Company Secretary","bodyFetched":true,"line":"New 15K MTPA R32 (HFC) capacity at Surat starts commercial operations — the ₹236.5 cr project approved in Oct 2025.","lineSource":"filing","eventTags":["plant commissioning","fluorochemicals","capex"]},{"id":"9282c8fde410","symbol":"KAYNES","company":"Kaynes Technology India Ltd","date":"2026-11-12","at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Execution Of Binding Term Sheet","subject":"Execution Of Binding Term Sheet","note":"Kaynes signed term sheet with Vishay for KSPL JV; Vishay to hold 49% stake in India OSAT business.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be77083a-3e44-4715-8501-b571f441c9c9.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"M&A","kind":"deal","baseScore":82,"readCost":26,"rule":"subject:scheme of arrangement|amalgamati","confidence":0.9,"body":"KAYNES TECHNOLOGY INDIA LIMITED CIN: L29128KA2008PLC045825 website: www.kaynestechnology.co.in email ID: kaynestechcs@kaynestechnology.net H.O & Registered office: 23-25, Belagola, Food Industrial Estate Metagalli PO, Mysore 570016 India Telephone No: +91 8212582595 November 12, 2026 BSE Limited Corporate Relationship Dept., 14th floor, P. J. Tower, Dalal Street, Fort Mumbai - 400 001 Scrip Code: 543664 National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Plot no. C/1, G Block, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai - 400 051 Scrip Symbol: KAYNES Dear Sir/Madam, Subject: Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements), Regulations, 2015. Pursuant to the provisions of Regulation 30 read with Part A of Schedule III and other applicable provisions of the Listing Regulations, we wish to inform you that Kaynes Technology India Limited (“Company”) has executed a binding term sheet (“Term Sheet”) dated November 12, 2026 amongst the Company (along with its Affiliate(s)), Kaynes Semicon Private Limited (“KSPL”), the wholly owned subsidiary of the Company, Vishay Intertechnology, Inc. (“Vishay”) and Ecomal Nederland B.V. (“Ecomal”), the wholly-owned subsidiary of Vishay, for the establishment of a joint venture through KSPL to provide semiconductor back-end manufacturing services. The joint venture business will include post-fab wafer processing, assembly, test and packaging (“OSAT”), and operate a Vishay captive line in India. Under the Term Sheet, Vishay will invest in KSPL for a 49% stake. The proposed transaction remains subject to the finalization of terms between the parties, execution of definitive agreements, required approvals and other customary closing conditions. The Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer of KSPL shall be Mr. Raghu Panicker, who shall be responsible for the day-to-day management and operation of the business. 1 Date of occurrence of Event / Information: November 12, 2026 2 Time of occurrence of Event/ Information: 19:16 IST The above information will also be made available on the website of the Company at www.kaynestechnology.co.in We request you to kindly take the above information on record and acknowledge it. Yours faithfully, For Kaynes Technology India Limited Sudhasri Addepalli Company Secretary and Compliance Officer ICSI Membership no.: ACS 79832","bodyFetched":true,"line":"Binding term sheet: Vishay to take 49% of Kaynes Semicon for an OSAT JV (assembly, test, packaging + a Vishay captive line in India). Raghu Panicker to run it.","lineSource":"filing","eventTags":["jv","osat","semiconductors","jv integration"],"orgs":["Vishay Intertechnology"],"people":[{"name":"Raghu Panicker","role":"MD & CEO, Kaynes Semicon (proposed JV)","action":"appointed","effective":null,"career":[{"org":"Kaynes Semicon","title":"MD & CEO","from":null,"to":null}],"education":[],"profileQuote":"The Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer of KSPL shall be Mr. Raghu Panicker, who shall be responsible for the day-to-day management and operation of the business.","profileSource":"filing"}]},{"id":"7024a8aaf506","symbol":"KAYNES","company":"Kaynes Technology India Ltd","date":"2026-11-12","at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Monitoring Agency Report","subject":"Monitoring Agency Report","note":"Monitoring agency reports for QIPs ended September 30, 2026; no material deviation in proceeds usage.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=2dcdf3d9-6aee-4b8b-b407-60aaacd54e59.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"unclassified","kind":"compliance","baseScore":3,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:trading window|compliance certif","confidence":0.9,"body":"KAYNES TECHNOLOGY IND