o being made available on the Company’s website at www.titancompany.in This is for your information and records. Yours truly, For TITAN COMPANY LIMITED Dinesh Shetty General Counsel & Company Secretary","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"e1e381b5e71c","symbol":"TITAN","company":"Titan Company Ltd","date":"2026-11-09","at":"2026-11-09T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","subject":"Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","note":null,"noteSource":null,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ced01c36-48bf-4c4c-a74b-d17875a41c27.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","confidence":0.9,"body":null,"bodyFetched":false},{"id":"b906e0c050bc","symbol":"ASIANPAINT","company":"Asian Paints Ltd","date":"2026-11-09","at":"2026-11-09T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","subject":"Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","note":"Asian Paints to meet Morgan Stanley and BlackRock in Singapore on 18-19 November 2026.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8a988798-8c55-42be-a6ce-6cb97abd6d5c.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","confidence":0.9,"body":null,"bodyFetched":false},{"id":"2bf81e85069b","symbol":"CGPOWER","company":"CG Power & Industrial Solutions Ltd","date":"2026-11-07","at":"2026-11-07T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement Under Regulation 30 Of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015 -Update","subject":"Update","note":"Aurangabad Bench stayed MPCB closure order for Waluj unit; unit contributes about 2.5% of revenue.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=76e41347-13f2-463f-b4d9-95374e297a34.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"litigation","kind":"regulatory","baseScore":65,"readCost":22,"rule":"body:(show cause|penalt|\\bfines?\\b|ad","confidence":0.65,"body":"CG Power and Industrial Solutions Limited Registered Office: ONE UNITY CENTER, Unit Nos. 1504-1508, Senapati Bapat Marg, Prabhadevi, Mumbai – 400013, India T: +91 22 3120 7700 W: www.cgglobal.com Corporate Identity Number: L99999MH1937PLC002641 Our Ref: COSEC/117/2026-27 7th November 2026 By portal The Corporate Relationship Department BSE Limited 1st Floor, New Trading Ring Rotunda Building, Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai 400 001 Scrip Code: 500093 The Assistant Manager - Listing National Stock Exchange of India Ltd. Exchange Plaza, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai 400 051 Scrip Id: CGPOWER Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Update- Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015. Further to our disclosure dated 5th November 2026 vide ref. COSEC/115/2026-27, we wish to inform you that the Hon'ble High Court (Aurangabad Bench) vide its order dated 6th November 2026 has stayed the Direction dated 3rd November 2026 of Maharashtra Pollution Control Board (“MPCB”) directing closure of manufacturing operations of the Company’s unit situated at Plot no. D-2, D1/2, MIDC, Waluj, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar under the Water (Prevention and Control of Pollution) Act, 1974 and/or the Air (Prevention and Control of Pollution) Act, 1981, and the rules framed thereunder, with notice to them returnable on 19th November 2026. We wish to further inform you that the said manufacturing unit contributes approx. 2.5% of the company's annual consolidated revenue. Thanking you. Yours faithfully, For CG Power and Industrial Solutions Limited Sanjay Kumar Chowdhary Company Secretary and Compliance Officer","bodyFetched":true,"line":"High Court stays the pollution board's closure or