information and records. Thanking You, Yours faithfully, For AU SMALL FINANCE BANK LIMITED Manmohan Parnami Company Secretary and Compliance Officer Membership No.: F9999","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"9ff6144edc4e","symbol":"HDFCBANK","company":"HDFC Bank Ltd","date":"2026-11-06","at":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Outcome of Postal_Ballot","subject":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Outcome of Postal_Ballot","note":"Shareholders approved Anup Bagchi as Director and MD & CEO on November 6, 2026.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=0926e958-96d9-4537-ae2b-188dfe3eb1d1.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"management_change","kind":"people","baseScore":85,"readCost":30,"rule":"body-upgrade:(appoint|cessation|resign|supera","confidence":0.75,"body":"Regd. Office: HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai – 400 013 Ref. No. SE/2026-27/144 November 6, 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Dept. of Corporate Services The Listing Department Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Exchange Plaza, Dalal Street, Fort, Bandra Kurla Complex, Mumbai – 400 001 Mumbai – 400 051 Scrip Code: 500180 Scrip Symbol: HDFCBANK Dear Sir / Madam, Sub: Intimation under Regulations 30 and 44 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“Listing Regulations”) In continuation of our earlier intimation dated October 7, 2026 and pursuant to Regulations 30 and 44 of the Listing Regulations, we hereby submit the results of e-voting on the resolution mentioned in the Postal Ballot Notice of the Bank dated October 1, 2026. Based on the report issued by the Scrutinizer i.e. Mr. Ashish Garg, Designated Partner of GDR & Partners LLP, we wish to inform you that the resolution placed before the shareholders for approval through postal ballot, has been passed with requisite majority and the same is deemed to have been approved on the last date of e-voting period i.e. Friday, November 6, 2026. Please find enclosed herewith the e-voting results in the prescribed format along with a Report issued by the Scrutinizer dated November 6, 2026. The aforesaid documents are also being made available on the Bank’s website and on the notice board at the Bank’s registered office. You are requested to kindly take the same on record. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For HDFC Bank Limited Ajay Agarwal Company Secretary Group Head – Secretarial & Group Oversight Encl.: a/a cc: New York Stock Exchange Singapore Exchange Securities Trading Limited 11, Wall Street, 2 Shenton Way New York, # 02-00 SGX Centre 1 NY 10005 Singapore 068804 USA CIN: L65920MH1994PLC080618 Email: shareholder.grievances@hdfc.bank.in Website: www.hdfc.bank.in HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC House, H T Parekh Marg, 165-166 Backbay Reclamation, Churchgate, Mumbai- 400 020 Tel. No.:022-66316000 GDR PARTNERS SCRUTINIZER'S REPORT [Pursuant to sections 108 and 110 of the Companies Act, 2013 and Rules 20 and 22 of the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014] Date: November 06, 2026 To, The Chairman HDFC Bank Limited HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai 400 013. Sub: HDFC Bank Limited - Scrutinizer's Report on Postal Ballot (E-voting) Results I, Ashish Garg, Practicing Company Secretary (FCS 5181) on behalf of GDR & Partners LLP, Company Secretaries had been appointed as a Scrutinizer by the Board of Directors of HDFC Bank Limited (hereinafter referred to as the \"Bank\") at its meeting held on October 1, 2026 to scrutinize the e-voting process in a fair and transparent manner in respect of the resolution as stated in the Postal Ballot Notice dated October 1, 2026 (the \"Postal Ballot Notice\"). In compliance with the provisions of Sections 108 and 110 of the Companies Act, 2013 (the \"Act\") read with Rule 20 and 22 of the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014, including any statutory amendment(s), modification(s), variation(s) or re-enactment(s) thereto, for the time being in force and in compliance with the applicable guidelines / circulars / rules issued by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs (\"MCA\") inter alia including General Circular No. 03/2025 dated September 22, 2025 read with other relevant circulars issued by MCA (\"MCA Circulars\") from time to time, Regulation 44 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (\"SEBI Listing Regulations\"), Secretarial Standard on General Meetings (\"SS-2\") issued by the Institute of Company Secretaries of India, and other applicable laws and regulations, if any, the following special business mentioned in the Postal Ballot Notice was proposed to be passed by the Members of the Bank by way of Postal Ballot through voting by electro","bodyFetched":true,"line":"Shareholders approve Anup Bagchi as Director and MD & CEO of HDFC Bank — the bank's top job changes hands.","lineSource":"filing","eventTags":["ceo succession","banking"],"people":[{"name":"Anup Bagchi","role":"Director and MD & CEO","action":"appointed","effective":"2026-11-06","career":[{"org":"ICICI Bank","title":"Joined the ICICI group","from":1992,"to":2011},{"org":"ICICI Securities","title":"MD & CEO","from":2011,"to":2017},{"org":"ICICI Bank","title":"Executive Director","from":2017,"to":2023},{"org":"ICICI Prudential Life Insurance","title":"MD & CEO","from":2023,"to":2026},{"org":"HDFC Bank","title":"MD & CEO","from":2026,"to":null}],"education":[{"institution":"IIT Kanpur","degree":"B.Tech"},{"institution":"IIM Bangalore","degree":"PGDM"}],"profileQuote":"the resolution placed before the shareholders for approval through postal ballot, has been passed with requisite majority","profileSource":"Appointment from this filing; career history summarised at build time from his public professional record (the full brief profile sits in the bank's 1 Oct 2026 postal-ballot notice)."}]},{"id":"9169f73d4cd2","symbol":"RELIANCE","company":"Reliance Industries Ltd","date":"2026-11-06","at":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","subject":"Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","note":"Reliance executives will attend a one-on-one CLSA India Forum meeting in Mumbai on November 16, 2026.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bab324f6-6fab-42fc-8b79-a3881f4fb7c7.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","confidence":0.9,"body":null,"bodyFetched":false},{"id":"b09408cca599","symbol":"LT","company":"Larsen & Toubro Ltd","date":"2026-11-06","at":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","subject":"Analyst / Investor Meet - Intimation","note":"L&T to attend Goldman Sachs, CITIC CLSA and JM Financial investor meetings in Mumbai on Nov 12, 16 and 17, 2026.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=9e23e65f-ffbd-4e61-be8c-a57227966831.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","confidence":0.9,"body":null,"bodyFetched":false},{"id":"f976203ff0be","symbol":"ASIANPAINT","company":"Asian Paints Ltd","date":"2026-11-06","at":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Outcome of Postal_Ballot","subject":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Outcome of Postal_Ballot","note":null,"noteSource":null,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=dd885c0b-f490-4da2-9fcc-a0ef6cfb76a3.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"management_change","kind":"people","baseScore":43,"readCost":30,"rule":"body-upgrade:(appoint|cessation|resign|supera","confidence":0.75,"body":"APL/SEC/54/2026-27/67 6th November 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G, Dalal Street, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai – 400 001 Mumbai – 400 051 Scrip Code: 500820 Symbol: ASIANPAINT Sir/Madam, Sub: Disclosure under Regulation 30 and Regulation 44 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“Listing Regulations”) – Outcome of Postal Ballot and Disclosure of Voting Results This is with reference to our letter no. APL/SEC/54/2026-27/58 dated 7th October 2026, whereby the Company had submitted the Postal Ballot Notice dated 7th September 2026 (‘Notice’), seeking approval of the shareholders of the Company for the following resolution: Type of Resolution Resolution Special Appointment of Mr. Leo Puri (DIN: 01764813) as an Independent Director of the Company, not liable to retire by rotation, to hold office for a term of five consecutive years commencing from 7th September 2026 to 6th September 2031 Pursuant to Sections 108, 110 and other applicable provisions, if any, of the Companies Act, 2013 (‘the Act’) read with the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014, guidelines prescribed by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs through various Circular(s) and Regulation 44 of the Listing Regulations, as amended from time to time, the Postal Ballot was conducted by way of voting through electronic means ('remote e-Voting') only. The remote e-voting process concluded today, i.e., Friday, 6th November 2026, at 5:00 p.m. (IST). Thereafter, Mr. Makarand M. Joshi (Membership No.: 5533, CP No.: 3662), Partner of Makarand M. Joshi & Co., Practicing Company Secretaries, the Scrutinizer appointed for the postal ballot process, submitted his report on the remote e-Voting results. Based on the report of the Scrutinizer, we hereby inform you that the members of the Company have approved the special resolution with requisite majority. In connection with the above, please find enclosed the following: Particulars Appendices Voting results of postal ballot pursuant to Regulation 44(3) of the Listing Regulations Appendix – 1 Scrutinizer's Report dated 6th November 2026 on remote e-Voting pursuant to Section 108 of the Act read with the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014 Appendix – 2 The voting results and the Scrutinizer’s report are being displayed on the notice board of the Company at its Registered Office and also being made available on the website of the Company at www.asianpaints.com and on the website of National Securities Depository Limited at www.evoting.nsdl.com. This is for your information and records. Thanking you, Yours truly, For ASIAN PAINTS LIMITED R J JEYAMURUGAN CFO & COMPANY SECRETARY Encl.: as above Appendix – 1 POSTAL BALLOT VOTING RESULTS [Pursuant to Regulation 44(3) of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015] Date of the Postal Ballot Notice 7th September 2026 (Voting start date: 8th October 2026 Voting end date: 6th November 2026) Total number of shareholders as on the record date (i.e. as on the cut-off date Friday, 2nd October 2026) 9,63,654 No. of shareholders present in the meeting either in person or through proxy: Promoter(s) and Promoter(s) group Not ApplicablePublic No. of shareholders attended the meeting through Video Conference: Promoter(s) and Promoter(s) group Not ApplicablePublic Resolution: Appointment of Mr. Leo Puri (DIN: 01764813) as an Independent Director of the Company, not liable to retire by rotation, to hold office for a term of five consecutive years commencing from 7th September 2026 to 6th September 2031 Resolution required: Special Whether Promoter/Promoter Group are interested in the agenda/ resolution? No Category Mode of voting Total no. of shares held No. of votes polled % of votes polled on outstan ding shares No. of votes - in favour No. of votes - against % of votes in favour on votes polled % of votes a","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"600427f739de","symbol":"ASIANPAINT","company":"Asian Paints Ltd","date":"2026-11-06","at":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Change in Directorate","subject":"Change in Directorate","note":"Shareholders approved Leo Puri as independent director; he becomes chairman from 23 January 2027.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6c189db-e010-4c6e-a997-b50d6d33767a.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"management_change","kind":"people","baseScore":85,"readCost":30,"rule":"subject:(appoint|cessation|resign|supera","confidence":0.9,"body":"APL/SEC/54/2026-27/68 6th November 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G, Dalal Street, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai – 400 001 Mumbai – 400 051 Scrip Code: 500820 Symbol: ASIANPAINT Sir/Madam, Sub: Disclosure under Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (‘the Listing Regulations’) - Shareholders’ approval for the appointment of Mr. Leo Puri as Independent Director of the Company The Company, vide its letter no. APL/SEC/57/2026-27/35 dated 7th September 2026, had informed the stock exchanges that the Board of Directors of the Company (‘the Board’), at its meeting held on the same day, based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, had unanimously approved the appointment of Mr. Leo Puri (DIN: 01764813) as an Additional and Independent Director of the Company for a first term of five (5) consecutive years commencing from 7th September 2026 to 6th September 2031, subject to the approval of the shareholders of the Company through Postal Ballot. Mr. Leo Puri shall assume office as Chairman of the Board with effect from 23rd January 2027, upon completion of the term of Mr. R. Seshasayee (DIN: 00047985) as Chairman and Independent Director on 22nd January 2027. This is to inform you that, based on the voting results of the Postal Ballot conducted through remote e-Voting, the shareholders of the Company have approved the appointment of Mr. Leo Puri as an Independent Director of the Company. The special resolution shall be deemed to have been passed on Friday, 6th November 2026, being the last date specified for remote e-Voting. The voting results and the Scrutinizer’s Report have been submitted separately pursuant to Regulation 44 of the Listing Regulations. The brief profile of Mr. Leo Puri, as required under Regulation 30 of the Listing Regulations, was disclosed by the Company vide its letter no. APL/SEC/57/2026-27/35 dated 7th September 2026 and is available on the website of the Company at www.asianpaints.com. Mr. Leo Puri is not related to any of the Directors and/or Key Managerial Personnel and/or members of the Promoter(s) & Promoter(s) Group of the Company. To the best of our knowledge and information, and as confirmed by Mr. Puri, he meets the criteria of independence as prescribed under the Companies Act, 2013 (‘the Act’) and the Listing Regulations and has not been debarred from holding the office as a Director of the Company, by virtue of an Order passed by the Securities and Exchange Board of India or any other authority. Further, as affirmed by him, he is not disqualified from holding the office as a Director pursuant to the provisions of Section 164 of the Act. You are requested to take the above information on record. Thanking you, Yours truly, For ASIAN PAINTS LIMITED R J JEYAMURUGAN CFO & COMPANY SECRETARY","bodyFetched":true,"line":"Leo Puri approved as Independent Director; he takes over as Chairman of Asian Paints from 23 Jan 2027.","lineSource":"filing","eventTags":["chairman change","board"],"people":[{"name":"Leo Puri","role":"Independent Director; Chairman from 23 Jan 2027","action":"appointed","effective":"2027-01-23","career":[{"org":"McKinsey & Company","title":"Director","from":null,"to":null},{"org":"Warburg Pincus","title":"Managing Director, India","from":null,"to":null},{"org":"UTI Asset Management","title":"Managing Director","from":2013,"to":2018},{"org":"J.P. Morgan","title":"Chairman, South & Southeast Asia","from":2019,"to":null}],"education":[],"profileQuote":"Mr. Leo Puri is not related to any of the Directors and/or Key Managerial Personnel and/or members of the Promoter(s) & Promoter(s) Group of the Company.","profileSource":"Appointment from this filing; career summarised at build time from his public professional record (filing points to the brief profile in Asian Paints' letter of 7 Sep 2026)."}]},{"id":"c3bca5a60aee","symbol":"ASIANPAINT","company":"Asian Paints Ltd","date":"2026-11-06","at":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Scrutinizer\"s Report","subject":"Shareholder Meeting / Postal Ballot-Scrutinizer\"s Report","note":null,"noteSource":null,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ddc90afe-51c7-4e86-984c-dbb5d641c44e.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"management_change","kind":"people","baseScore":43,"readCost":30,"rule":"body-upgrade:(appoint|cessation|resign|supera","confidence":0.75,"body":"APL/SEC/54/2026-27/67 6th November 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G, Dalal Street, Bandra-Kurla Complex, Bandra (East), Mumbai – 400 001 Mumbai – 400 051 Scrip Code: 500820 Symbol: ASIANPAINT Sir/Madam, Sub: Disclosure under Regulation 30 and Regulation 44 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“Listing Regulations”) – Outcome of Postal Ballot and Disclosure of Voting Results This is with reference to our letter no. APL/SEC/54/2026-27/58 dated 7th October 2026, whereby the Company had submitted the Postal Ballot Notice dated 7th September 2026 (‘Notice’), seeking approval of the shareholders of the Company for the following resolution: Type of Resolution Resolution Special Appointment of Mr. Leo Puri (DIN: 01764813) as an Independent Director of the Company, not liable to retire by rotation, to hold office for a term of five consecutive years commencing from 7th September 2026 to 6th September 2031 Pursuant to Sections 108, 110 and other applicable provisions, if any, of the Companies Act, 2013 (‘the Act’) read with the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014, guidelines prescribed by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs through various Circular(s) and Regulation 44 of the Listing Regulations, as amended from time to time, the Postal Ballot was conducted by way of voting through electronic means ('remote e-Voting') only. The remote e-voting process concluded today, i.e., Friday, 6th November 2026, at 5:00 p.m. (IST). Thereafter, Mr. Makarand M. Joshi (Membership No.: 5533, CP No.: 3662), Partner of Makarand M. Joshi & Co., Practicing Company Secretaries, the Scrutinizer appointed for the postal ballot process, submitted his report on the remote e-Voting results. Based on the report of the Scrutinizer, we hereby inform you that the members of the Company have approved the special resolution with requisite majority. In connection with the above, please find enclosed the following: Particulars Appendices Voting results of postal ballot pursuant to Regulation 44(3) of the Listing Regulations Appendix – 1 Scrutinizer's Report dated 6th November 2026 on remote e-Voting pursuant to Section 108 of the Act read with the Companies (Management and Administration) Rules, 2014 Appendix – 2 The voting results and the Scrutinizer’s report are being displayed on the notice board of the Company at its Registered Office and also being made available on the website of the Company at www.asianpaints.com and on the website of National Securities Depository Limited at www.evoting.nsdl.com. This is for your information and records. Thanking you, Yours truly, For ASIAN PAINTS LIMITED R J JEYAMURUGAN CFO & COMPANY SECRETARY Encl.: as above Appendix – 1 POSTAL BALLOT VOTING RESULTS [Pursuant to Regulation 44(3) of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015] Date of the Postal Ballot Notice 7th September 2026 (Voting start date: 8th October 2026 Voting end date: 6th November 2026) Total number of shareholders as on the record date (i.e. as on the cut-off date Friday, 2nd October 2026) 9,63,654 No. of shareholders present in the meeting either in person or through proxy: Promoter(s) and Promoter(s) group Not ApplicablePublic No. of shareholders attended the meeting through Video Conference: Promoter(s) and Promoter(s) group Not ApplicablePublic Resolution: Appointment of Mr. Leo Puri (DIN: 01764813) as an Independent Director of the Company, not liable to retire by rotation, to hold office for a term of five consecutive years commencing from 7th September 2026 to 6th September 2031 Resolution required: Special Whether Promoter/Promoter Group are interested in the agenda/ resolution? No Category Mode of voting Total no. of shares held No. of votes polled % of votes polled on outstan ding shares No. of votes - in favour No. of votes - against % of votes in favour on votes polled % of votes a","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"ada749f47ea9","symbol":"POLYCAB","company":"Polycab India Ltd","date":"2026-11-06","at":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement Under Regulation 30 (LODR) - Analyst(S) / Investor(S) Meet - Intimation","subject":"Analyst(S) / Investor(S) Meet - Intimation","note":null,"noteSource":null,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=72c96165-b9ed-4b62-ac86-80cc440b32ff.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","confidence":0.9,"body":null,"bodyFet