b: Intimation for Change in Corporate Office Address of Kfin Technologies Limited , Registrar and Share Transfer Agent (RTA) of the Company Dear Sir/Madam, With reference to the captioned subject, we would like to inform you that the Registrar and Share Transfer Agent (RTA) of the Company i.e. KFin Technologies Limited has informed the Company regarding the shifting and change in their existing corporate office address to their below mentioned address w.e.f. December 01, 2026; The new address of the Corporate Office of the RTA is: KFin Technologies Limited, 6,23,24,25th Floor, South Tower, Rajapushpa West Avenue, Survey No. 115, Kokapet, Serilingampally Mandal, Ranga Reddy District. Telangana - 500075 Contact Details: Toll Free/Phone Number : 1800 309 4001 | (91) 81210 13657 Email: statutoryandcompliance@kfintech.com , einward.ris@kfintech.com Website: https://www.kfintech.com/ Kindly note that all future correspondence, communications, notices, documents and other business-related communications related to corporate office, may kindly be addressed to the above-mentioned new Corporate Office address with effect from the effective date. Please note that the change pertains solely to the Corporate Office address of the RTA. There is no change in the name of the RTA, its registered office, or its appointment as Registrar and Share Transfer Agent of the Company. This is for your information and records. Yours faithfully For SRF Limited Rajat Lakhanpal Sr. VP (Corporate Compliance) & Company Secretary","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"4d8ae167b53c","symbol":"SRF","company":"SRF Ltd","date":"2026-11-05","at":"2026-11-05T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Disclosure Under Regulation 30 Of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015","subject":"","note":"Uttarakhand tax officer imposed ₹12.77 lakh penalty over Delivery Challan and e-way bill mismatch.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=55173153-1fa0-40c4-acbb-6ec58db8fc4a.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"litigation","kind":"regulatory","baseScore":25,"readCost":22,"rule":"body:(show cause|penalt|\\bfines?\\b|ad","confidence":0.65,"body":"The Corporate Relationship Department, BSE Limited 1st Floor, New Trading Ring Rotunda Building, P.J. Towers Dalal Street, Mumbai 400 001 Scrip Code- 503806 National Stock Exchange of India Limited “Exchange Plaza” Bandra-Kurla Complex Bandra (E) Mumbai 400 051 Scrip Code-SRF SRF/SEC/BSE/NSE 5.11.2026 Sub: Disclosure under Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 Dear Sir, This disclosure is being made pursuant to the SEBI (Listing Obligations & Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“LODR”). Disclosures under Schedule III, Part-A, Para A (Clause 20) of LODR is given below: i) Name of Authority Office of State Tax Officer, Uttarakhand ii) Nature and details of the action(s) taken, initiated or order(s) passed; Order imposing a penalty of ₹12,77,382 by the State Tax Officer, Uttarakhand, in relation to an alleged mismatch between the particulars mentioned in the Delivery Challan and E-way Bill. iii) Date of receipt of direction or order, including any ad-interim or interim orders, or any other communication from the authority; 04.11.2026 at 01.31 p.m. iv) Details of the violation(s)/contravention(s) committed or alleged to be committed; The matter relates to a clerical oversight wherein inadvertently in the Delivery challan the tax amount was reflected as Nil. This is well reflected by the fact that the E-way bill generated which was accompanying the goods being moved correctly disclosed the accurate GST amount. v) impact on financial, operation or other activities of the listed entity, quantifiable in monetary terms to the extent possible. The financial impact is limited to the penalty amount of ₹12,77,382 which has been paid under protest. As described above, the movement of goods was undertaken under a Delivery Challan against a taxable invoice, and the applicable GST had already been duly discharged through the corresponding tax invoice. There is, therefore, no additional tax liability or loss of revenue to the Government. This issue has therefore arisen nearly due to a procedural/ clerical error and does not alter the substance of the transaction. The Company is therefore of the view that the demand is not legally tenable and will contest the same before the appropriate legal forum(s). Kindly take this intimation on record. Thanking you, Yours faithfully, For SRF Limited Rajat Lakhanpal Sr. Vice President (Corporate Compliance) & Company Secretary","bodyFetched":true},{"id":"1b0cc9982f00","symbol":"DIXON","company":"Dixon Technologies (India) Ltd","date":"2026-11-05","at":"2026-11-05T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Allotment of ESOP / ESPS","subject":"Allotment of ESOP / ESPS","note":"Company has allotted 37,750 equity shares under DIXON ESOP 2020 on 05th November 2026.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bdab8a75-541a-4c8e-bd67-a4c1e81d0a22.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"unclassified","kind":"esop","baseScore":3,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:allotment of (equity shares unde","confidence":0.9,"body":"Dixon Technologies (India) Limited 05th November, 2026 To, Secretary Listing Department BSE Limited Department of Corporate Services Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400 001 To, Secretary Listing Department National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza, Bandra Kurla Complex Mumbai – 400 051 Scrip Code – 540699 ISIN: INE935N01020 Scrip Code – DIXON ISIN: INE935N01020 Dear Sir / Madam, Pursuant to Regulation 30 and other applicable regulations of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we would like to inform that the Share Allotment Committee of Dixon Technologies (India) Limited (“Company”) at its meeting held on 05th Novem