ceasing as Group Head, Business Banking.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b36ff756-1cf7-44a3-9b2c-4583e7e0e792.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"management_change","kind":"people","baseScore":67,"readCost":30,"rule":"subject:(appoint|cessation|resign|supera","confidence":0.9,"body":"Regd. Office: HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC Bank House, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel (West), Mumbai – 400 013 Ref. No. SE/2026-27/141 October 31, 2026 BSE Limited National Stock Exchange of India Limited Dept of Corporate Services The Listing Department Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers, Exchange Plaza Dalal Street, Fort, Bandra Kurla Complex, Mumbai 400 001 Mumbai 400 051 Scrip code: 500180 Scrip code: HDFCBANK Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Disclosure under Regulation 30 read with Clause 7 of Paragraph A of Part A of Schedule III of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“SEBI Listing Regulations”) We wish to inform you that Mr. Sanjay D’Souza has superannuated from the services of the Bank with effect from the close of business hours on October 31, 2026 and has accordingly ceased to be the Group Head – Business Banking, Emerging & Micro Enterprises Group and a Senior Management Personnel of the Bank. During his association with the Bank for nearly 27 years, Mr. Sanjay D’Souza was one of the key architects of the Bank’s SME business, contributing significantly across both Credit and Business. Under his leadership, the Bank established a strong leadership position in this space. The Bank would like to place on record its sincere appreciation for the dedicated services provided by Mr. Sanjay D’Souza. This is for your information and appropriate dissemination. Thank you. Yours faithfully, For HDFC Bank Limited Ajay Agarwal Company Secretary Group Head – Secretarial & Group Oversight Copy to: 1. New York Stock Exchange 2. Singapore Exchange Securities Trading Limited 11, Wall Street, New York 2 Shenton Way 068804 NY 10005, USA # 02-00 SGX Centre 1 Singapore CIN: L65920MH1994PLC080618 Email: shareholder.grievances@hdfc.bank.in Website: www.hdfc.bank.in HDFC Bank Limited, HDFC House, H.T. Parekh Marg 165-166, Backbay Reclamation, Churchgate, Mumbai- 400020 Tel.:022-66316000","bodyFetched":true,"line":"Sanjay D'Souza — ~27 years at the bank and 'a key architect' of its SME franchise — retires as Group Head, Business Banking.","lineSource":"filing","eventTags":["leadership exit","sme lending"],"people":[{"name":"Sanjay D'Souza","role":"Group Head – Business Banking, Emerging & Micro Enterprises","action":"retired","effective":"2026-10-31","career":[{"org":"HDFC Bank","title":"Group Head – Business Banking","from":1999,"to":2026}],"education":[],"profileQuote":"During his association with the Bank for nearly 27 years, Mr. Sanjay D’Souza was one of the key architects of the Bank’s SME business","profileSource":"filing"}]},{"id":"0dfa7264ffbe","symbol":"SUNPHARMA","company":"Sun Pharmaceutical Industries Ltd","date":"2026-10-31","at":"2026-10-31T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Completion And Results Of Postal Ballot Dated 01 October 2026","subject":"Completion And Results Of Postal Ballot Dated 01 October 2026","note":"Postal ballot completed on 31 Oct 2026; members approved ESOP 2026, borrowing limit and related resolutions.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e87d46d8-c447-4fc2-9b82-a95a8a922b0f.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"press_release","kind":"press","baseScore":34,"readCost":10,"rule":"body-upgrade:order|contract|bagging|wins?|lau","confidence":0.75,"body":"Sun Pharmaceutical Industries Limited Sun House, Plot No. 201 B/1, Western Express Highway, Goregaon (E), Mumbai – 400 063, Maharashtra, INDIA. Tel. : (91-22) 4324 4324 Fax : (91-22) 4324 4343 Website: www.sunpharma.com Email: secretarial@sunpharma.com CIN: L24230GJ1993PLC019050 Registered Office: SPARC, Tandalja, Vadodara – 390 012, 