i, MH - 400051 Scrip Code: 542652 Scrip Symbol: POLYCAB ISIN: INE455K01017 Dear Sir(s) / Madam(s), Subject: Disclosure under Regulation 30 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015 – update on appeal in the matter of Asier Metals Private Limited vs. Polycab India Limited. In continuation our earlier intimations dated October 07, 2026, October 08, 2026, October 09, 2026, October 14, 2026, October 16, 2026 and October 28, 2026, we wish to inform that in the matter of Asier Metals Private Limited vs. Polycab India Limited (\"Company\"), the Hon'ble NCLAT vide its order dated October 30, 2026 has allowed the Appeal filed by the Company and set aside the order of the Hon'ble National Company Law Tribunal, Ahmedabad Bench dated October 07, 2026. A copy of the order of the Hon'ble NCLAT is attached herewith. Kindly take the same on your record. Thanking you Yours Faithfully, For Polycab India Limited _________________________ Manita Carmen A. Gonsalves Vice President-Legal and Company Secretary Membership No.: A18321 Address: #29, The Ruby, 21st Floor, Senapati Bapat Marg, Tulsi Pipe Road, Dadar (West), Mumbai, MH-400028 ","bodyFetched":true,"line":"NCLAT allows Polycab's appeal and sets aside NCLT Ahmedabad's 7 Oct order in Asier Metals vs Polycab.","lineSource":"filing","eventTags":["insolvency","litigation"]},{"id":"8f3104cc37e8","symbol":"CGPOWER","company":"CG Power & Industrial Solutions Ltd","date":"2026-10-29","at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","timePrecision":"day","title":"Announcement under Regulation 30 (LODR)-Analyst / Investor Meet - Outcome","subject":"Analyst / Investor Meet - Outcome","note":"Transcript of 23 October 2026 analyst and investor conference call uploaded on company website.","noteSource":"screener.in","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=99a41c5a-1dbc-493e-a92b-b47caa3f98f4.pdf","source":"screener/bse","category":"investor_meetings","kind":"meeting","baseScore":6,"readCost":3,"rule":"subject:analyst|investor meet|institutio","co