, Dalal Street, Mumbai 400 001 Ref: Scrip Code: 533179 Dear Sir/Madam, Sub: Outcome of the Special Committee Meeting held on October 26, 2026 in relation to the allotment of Equity Shares under Qualified Institutional Placement pursuant to the provisions of Chapter VI of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Issue of Capital and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2018, as amended (the “SEBI ICDR Regulations”) Ref.: Our earlier letter bearing Ref. No. NSE & BSE / 2026-27 / 170 dated October 26, 2026 In continuation of the above referred intimation read with Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we wish to inform you that the Special Committee of the Board of Directors at its 2nd meeting held on Monday, October 26, 2026, commenced at 2247 Hrs. (IST) and concluded at 2308 Hrs. (IST), has inter-alia considered and approved the allotment of 7,683,981 Equity Shares to qualified institutions buyers under Qualified Institutional Placement at the issue price of INR 5,550.00 per Equity Share, (which includes a discount of INR 211.00 per Equity Share (i.e., 3.66% of the floor price, as determined in terms of the SEBI ICDR Regulations) i.e. at a premium of INR 5,545.00 per Equity Share, aggregating to INR 42,646.09 million, pursuant to the Issue. Consequent to the aforesaid allotment, the paid-up equity share capital of the Company stands increased to from INR 790,750,000/- consisting of 158,150,000 Equity Shares of INR 5 per share to INR 829,169,905/- consisting of 165,833,981 Equity Shares. The Issue opened on October 21, 2026, and closed on October 26, 2026, and the same was intimated to you through our letters dated October 21, 2026, and October 26, 2026, respectively. The list of allottees who have been allotted more than 5% of the Equity Shares offered in the Issue is enclosed to this letter as Annexure A. Persistent Systems Limited, Bhageerath, 402 Senapati Bapat Road, Pune 411 016, Maharashtra, India CIN - L7